      },
      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>Close on one troll head with a waxed moustache, a gold earring and a raised, supercilious brow, speaking with the poise of a diplomat.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.wdlbFe4qIZDYqrwL]{03. Nine Mouths, One Belly}.</strong> The head that mimics Ser Halward Toll and speaks for the Envoy bloc. It shares the Jotund Troll's defences, which take any damage; its courtly skills serve its lies and Sense Motive against it.</p>"
    },
